# Go stdlib os.Root symlink traversal in the prebuilt tsc binary that
# TypeScript bundles (@typescript/typescript-linux-*), compiled upstream
# with Go 1.26.4. Not fixable from our Dockerfiles; remove this entry
# once TypeScript publishes binaries built with Go 1.26.5 or later.
CVE-2026-39822

# Infinite loop in golang.org/x/text norm.Iter, vendored into the same
# prebuilt tsc binary. TypeScript 7.0.2 (current latest) still links
# v0.38.0, so `npm install -g typescript` cannot pick up the 0.39.0 fix.
# Remove once TypeScript publishes binaries built against x/text 0.39.0.
CVE-2026-56852

# Kernel CVEs matched against linux-libc-dev, the kernel headers that
# build-essential pulls into the toolchain image. Headers only: the
# container never runs the kernel they describe. The fixed version
# (6.12.96-1) is in trixie-proposed-updates, so apt cannot reach it even
# on a no-cache rebuild. Remove once 6.12.96-1 lands in trixie proper.
CVE-2026-53399
CVE-2026-64600

# Denial of service in brace-expansion, vendored inside npm's own bundled
# dependency tree. npm 12.0.1 (current latest) still ships 5.0.7, so the
# toolchain's `npm install -g npm@latest` cannot pick up the 5.0.8 fix.
# Remove once npm publishes a release bundling brace-expansion 5.0.8.
CVE-2026-14257
